      , `Regs Sch I s 3(9) the place is in the region of North Western Quebec` place
      , `Regs Sch I s 3(10) the place is in the region of Hull` place
      , `Regs Sch I s 3(11) the place is in the region of Lower Saint Lawrence and North Shore` place
      , `Regs Sch I s 3(12) the place is in the region of Chicoutimi — Jonquière` place
      , `Regs Sch I s 4(1) the place is in the region of Eastern Nova Scotia` place
