#ASSERT `Regs Sch I the region that the place is in` (`er6 test place` `er6 Prince Edward Island` 0 0 `er6 no Census Metropolitan Area` `er6 Charlottetown CA` FALSE) EQUALS JUST `er6 the region of Charlottetown`
#ASSERT `Regs Sch I the region that the place is in` (`er6 test place` `er6 Prince Edward Island` 0 0 `er6 no Census Metropolitan Area` `er6 no Census Agglomeration` FALSE) EQUALS JUST `er6 the region of Prince Edward Island`
#ASSERT `Regs Sch I the region that the place is in` (`er6 test place` `er6 Yukon` 0 0 `er6 no Census Metropolitan Area` `er6 Whitehorse CA` FALSE) EQUALS JUST `er6 the region of Whitehorse`
